20
00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.353
taking the needle point world by storm.

21
00:00:57.606 --> 00:01:00.500
Jonah and I met and we became fast friends.

22
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.050
Look! Remember back when we could hug?

23
00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:06.180
Jonah's wise beyond his years,

24
00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.590
