146
00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.510 line:15%
The project I would recommend is,

147
00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.820
it's actually a hat pattern that I made.

148
00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.870
It's a pattern from yourowninspirations.com,

149
00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.470 line:15%
you can find it'll be up on Drew Barrymore's website

150
00:06:45.118 --> 00:06:47.880 line:15%
it uses a chunkier yarn, so that way,

151
00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.120 line:15%
you can use a big hook and it goes faster,

152
00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.400
and it's also easier to start for a beginner,

153
00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.260
so I recommend using that hat to start with your daughter.

154
00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.648
Thank you so much.

155
00:06:56.648 --> 00:06:59.589
(applause)

156
00:06:59.589 --> 00:07:01.650
Thank you so much, alright.

157
00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.850
Next, we're going to Natalie.

158
00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:05.683
Hi Jonah.

159
00:07:05.683 --> 00:07:06.516
Hello.

160
00:07:06.516 --> 00:07:07.740
So I love to crochet,

161
00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.040
