185
00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.410
So there's so many different things you can do

186
00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:08.410
to combine the love of crafting and being a fiber artist

187
00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.580
with giving back, and I make sure I just do that

188
00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.120
